      "reason": "It supplies multiple named AI startups and adjacent competitors, while noting the exact target industry is undefined.",
      "report_quote": "**VoiceRun** — AI voice-agent platform for developers; raised a $5.5M seed led by Flybridge Capital (Jan 2026)."
    },
    {
